          "type": "data",
          "data": {
            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><h2 id=\"generated-compton-scattering\">Generated Compton scattering</h2>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">Generate the two <marimo-tex class=\"arithmatex\">||(e^-\\gamma \\to e^-\\gamma||)</marimo-tex> amplitudes, form their Dirac\nadjoint with Idenso, and contract the physical spin sums shared with\nGammaLoop. Both diagrams and their interference are retained. This agrees\nwith the full massive <a href=\"https://feyncalc.github.io/FeynCalcExamples/QED/Tree/ElGa-ElGa\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">FeynCalc result</a>.</span>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">External ports come from the generated wavefunctions. The adjoint gets its\nown index names; the mass, charge, external momenta and invariants are real.\nIncoming spins are averaged and outgoing spins are summed.</span></span>"
          }
        }
      ],
      "console": []
